@UnitConverter.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5117

### Length: Meter to Millimeter
POST {{UnitConverter.Api_HostAddress}}/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "length",
  "fromUnit": "meter",
  "toUnit": "millimeter",
  "value": 1
}

### Length: Meter to Centimeter
POST {{UnitConverter.Api_HostAddress}}/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "length",
  "fromUnit": "meter",
  "toUnit": "centimeter",
  "value": 1
}

